{"tool": "gh", "argv": ["pr", "create", "--base", "fh/5-place-order-notes", "--head", "fh/6-coupon-last-day", "--title", "Coupons stay valid through their expiry date (6)", "--body", "A coupon added with `--expires 2026-03-31` was rejected on 2026-03-31. `validate_coupon` now rejects only when the order date is after the expiry date, so the expiry date is the last valid day. Regression tests for the last valid day and the day after, at pricing and CLI level; the place-order notes say \"after\" instead of \"on or after\".\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)"], "cwd": "/private/var/folders/fd/j548rpgd0bz5n99xbntzf0100000gn/T/fh-eta-validate-r2/p3-orders-opus/repo"}
